WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.552
Hi! Today we learn the alphabet.

2
00:00:06.952 --> 00:00:11.208
And you learn the question: How do you spell that?

3
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:19.004
The alphabet has 26 letters. Listen:

4
00:00:19.404 --> 00:00:21.620
A as in Apfel (apple).

5
00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.092
B as in Ball.

6
00:00:24.492 --> 00:00:26.804
C as in Clown.

7
00:00:27.204 --> 00:00:29.516
D as in Delfin (dolphin).

8
00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:32.444
E as in Elefant (elephant).

9
00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:35.108
F as in Fisch (fish).

10
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:42.424
German also has special letters. Listen carefully:

11
00:00:42.824 --> 00:00:45.136
ä as in Käse (cheese).

12
00:00:45.536 --> 00:00:47.728
ö as in schön (beautiful).

13
00:00:48.128 --> 00:00:50.368
ü as in fünf (five).

14
00:00:50.768 --> 00:00:56.344
ß as in Straße (street). It sounds like a double s.

15
00:00:58.033 --> 00:01:05.385
Careful! Two letters, one sound. We say ei like ai:

16
00:01:05.785 --> 00:01:08.889
mein, drei, Wein.

17
00:01:09.289 --> 00:01:12.729
And we say ie like a long i:

18
00:01:13.129 --> 00:01:16.137
Wien, Brief, sie.

19
00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:22.881
You don't understand a name? Then you ask:

20
00:01:23.281 --> 00:01:25.857
How do you spell that?

21
00:01:26.257 --> 00:01:29.457
And the person spells:

22
00:01:29.857 --> 00:01:34.569
Lena. L, E, N, A.

23
00:01:36.267 --> 00:01:40.211
Listen: Ana is at the language school.

24
00:01:40.611 --> 00:01:43.547
What's your name, please?

25
00:01:43.947 --> 00:01:46.211
Ana Gómez.

26
00:01:46.611 --> 00:01:49.187
How do you spell that?

27
00:01:49.587 --> 00:01:53.603
G – O – M – E – Z.

28
00:01:54.003 --> 00:01:57.011
Thank you, Ms Gómez!

29
00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:05.404
Now you! Spell your name. Slowly!

30
00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:17.236
Great! Now you can:

31
00:02:17.636 --> 00:02:24.844
You know the alphabet and the umlauts. And you can spell your name.

32
00:02:25.244 --> 00:02:27.364
See you soon!
